SUMMARY:SMC x Luna Stage present Hamlet!
DESCRIPTION:South Mountain Conservancy Activities Meetup Group\n**Shakespe
 are Under the Stars — South Mountain Conservancy and Luna Stage Brings H
 AMLET to South Mountain Reservation**\n\nFree!\n\nWe're thrilled to host [
 Luna Stage](https://www.lunastage.org/)'s touring production of ***Hamlet*
 ** as it makes its way through parks in Orange and West Orange this July! 
 Watch six talented actors bring 15 roles to life in a fast-paced\, 105-min
 ute retelling of this timeless tale of love\, betrayal\, and vengeance in 
 a land desperate for a hero.\n\n**Thursday\, July 16th**\n**Mayapple Hill 
 - South Mountain Reservation**\n**Event area opens - 6:30pm**\n**Performan
 ce - 8pm**\n\nPack a picnic\, grab your blankets and camping chairs\, and 
 don't forget a flashlight — this is a **FREE** evening of Shakespeare yo
 u won't want to miss!\n\n**We kindly ask you RSVP on the Luna Stage Hamlet
  show page: [HAMLET](https://www.lunastage.org/hamlet-1)**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/somocon/events/315505576/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260701T220502Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260701T220502Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
