 sent to photos of me being used in promotional materials or on social medi
 a.\n\nFor information\, contact program coordinator Lori LaBorde at citize
 nscience@[somocon.org](http://somocon.org/)\n\n**Meet at the meadow after 
 parking in Shady Nook Picnic Area.**
